+ ```tabular

- column  Outcome
- column  Meaning
- row  `FastForwarded(head)`  the branch moved forward to `head`, with no merge commit
- row  `Merged(head)`  a merge commit, `head`, was created
- row  `UpToDate`  there was nothing to merge
- row  `Stopped(operation)`  the merge stopped on a conflict
+ column  Исход
+ column  Значение
+ row  `FastForwarded(head)`  ветка перемотана вперёд до `head` без коммита слияния
+ row  `Merged(head)`  создан коммит слияния `head`
+ row  `UpToDate`  сливать было нечего
+ row  `Stopped(operation)`  слияние остановилось на конфликте

= row  `Stopped(operation)`  the merge stopped on a conflict
